{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他这次没藏住喜欢，被对方看出很在乎，随后开始担心两人的相处会变得尴尬。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、忐忑、怕被嫌太黏、患得患失\",\n      \"missed\": \"前几次想说又收住、对方始终亲近的前后对比；耳语般靠近后交谈突然停止，以及心里闪过的“这份幸福真实吗”；末尾“像终于能深吸一口气”和右侧三条小标签也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他这次暴露了自己的喜欢，对方看出了他的在乎，但他反而不知道接下来该怎么相处。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、紧张、害怕被嫌弃、亲近中的不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"之前几次欲言又止、对方一直没有疏远他的细节；两个人刚才贴近耳语却突然停止交谈的具体画面，以及“幸福真实吗”的疑问，需要再读小字才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于没能藏住喜欢，被对方看出有多在乎，之后却担心自己太黏，让原本亲近的关系产生距离。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"失落、忐忑、患得患失、害怕被嫌弃\",\n      \"missed\": \"前几次想说又收住与这次没藏住的时间对比；耳语之后交谈戛然而止的画面，以及“这份幸福真实吗”和“像终于能深吸一口气”这两处补充情绪。下方多条金色轨迹也比前两张更密一些。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段大字的核心事件和感受其实能够连起来，紫色高亮也有效地标出了“没藏住喜欢—被看出在乎—心里空落落—怕被嫌太黏”这条线。主要问题是每段大字都很长，一段里同时塞入前后对比、当前状态和多层心理活动，第一眼容易只抓到紫色关键词，未必能完整抓住事情的发展。真正补足人物当下画面的“耳语后突然停止交谈”和“幸福真实吗”字号明显更小，容易漏掉。因此能抓住主线，但不容易同时抓住人物此刻的具体处境和细腻变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eea61bf0-09b3-4c8a-b9bd-806021b8ef3f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224053165737Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:42:18.798835+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "479d80a293def94ea37e13e0459997674b76f776e98f675d4f11566667e36069", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224053165737Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d06b16486a474a03ed2759dfdbfc8d0065db338202a55db92dff3bc7718884c5"}}}
